  0.28.6 (PLAN-spoton-codex-rm-stash-rootcause follow-up): grant the Bash TOOL
  only when this agent actually dispatches codex (codex_second_opinion.enabled
  AND name in its agents list) — the SAME condition as
  codex_permission_line.md.j2 (the allow line and the tool must move in lockstep).

  WHY conditional, not the 0.28.5 unconditional form: subagent-frontmatter
  `permissions.deny` is NOT enforced by Claude Code (only `tools:` and
  settings.json are — see CLAUDE.md §보안/권한 enforcement note + failures.md
