  tool on a reviewer = unrestricted shell regardless of the deny block. Gating
  the tool on codex_second_opinion confines that surface to users who opted in.

  Whitespace: outer `{%-`/`-%}` + inline `{% endif -%}` strip surrounding
  newlines so the disabled branch is byte-zero (matches codex_permission_line
  ADR-007 P-W1). Defensive `.get()` so partial config dicts don't raise.
-#}
